  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your divine insights provide deadly expertise on the battlefield.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Adept Champion<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Activating this feat is a free action rather than a swift action. In addition, on any round in which you do not activate this feat you gain a +1 sacred bonus on combat maneuver checks against the target of your smite for every 5 points of your base attack bonus.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc7\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
